[en.CHARACTER_QUEEN_NOVO_NAME]
Queen Novo

[en.CHARACTER_QUEEN_NOVO_DESC]
As an enlightened and capable monarch, Queen Novo has ruled the Hippogriff-Seapony Confederation for many years. During her reign, the country completed constitutional reforms, avoided the invasion of the Storm Empire, and led everypony out of the years of isolation that followed. Although the trend of separate governance between the Hippogriffs and Seaponies is growing stronger, and the situation on the southern coast is not optimistic, there is no doubt that the queen is the cornerstone of stability in our country.

[zh.CHARACTER_QUEEN_NOVO_NAME]
诺沃女皇

[zh.CHARACTER_QUEEN_NOVO_DESC]
作为一名开明有能的君主，诺沃女王已经统治骏鹰和海马的邦联多年。在她任上，国家完成了宪政改革，躲避了风暴帝国的入侵并在之后带领大家走出了持续多年的孤立情况。尽管如今骏鹰与海马分家而治的趋势增强，南方海岸的局势也不容乐观，但毫无疑问，女王是我们国家稳定的基石。
